From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Julien Etienne <julien.etienne@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 15:18:47 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: mediatek: gemini station: add the battery and
 fuel gauge

Describe the Gemini PDA battery as a simple battery with its capacity and
OCV profiles at four temperatures, and the MT6351 fuel gauge that monitors
it: a 10 mOhm sense resistor, the vendor kernel's effective gain
correction of 115, and the battery thermal zone for its temperature.
---
 .../mediatek/mt6797-gemini-pda-station.dts    | 122 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 122 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6797-gemini-pda-station.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6797-gemini-pda-station.dts
index 87a6afc93..e4578be77 100644
