+	/*
+	 * The Gemini PDA's 4.35 V-class cell: the vendor's capacity at 25 C
+	 * and its OCV profiles at -10, 0, 25 and 50 C (capacity in percent
+	 * against the open-circuit voltage). The internal resistance is the
+	 * 25 C profile's mid-range cell resistance plus the 75 mOhm meter path.
+	 */
